  clientName: Clark
  jobDescription: "Connect the factory access road across the 80-meter channel. Keep the SUV's lane closer to one side to work around the existing equipment, and carry it safely to the opposite bank. Review why an off-center load can create torsion in a real bridge."
  budget: 600000
  liveLoadWeight: 1000
  bridgeSpan: 80
  twoWayRoad: 1
  twoWayRoadWidth: 16
